  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with the custom footballer comforter set from Jeminise. This soft and lightweight bedding is designed for football lovers, players, and fans, featuring a striking graphic illustration of a football player holding a ball. Perfectly combining style and athletic passion, it adds a vibrant, energetic touch to any kids' room, teen bedroom, or guestroom decor.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with two text inputs, allowing you to add your preferred name and number for a truly unique sports-themed look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling that prevents clumping or shifting, providing a super soft and cozy feel in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Available in multiple sizes to suit any bed, including Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set package includes one high-quality comforter (or duvet cover) and optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Durable and quick-drying fabric is machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat to keep it fluffy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Footballer Hold the Ball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sports: Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football Player Holding Ball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
